// @param data {*} Any data to convert to a char data type
//
// @returns {char} Data with same shape of char type
.z.m.axq.asChar:i.cast["c"; 2h; {$[-11h ~ type x; first string x; 11h ~ type x; "c"$first each string x; "c"$x]}]

// @fileOverview
